# Initial selection singleplayer; Enter starts its original intro then controls move.
at 100 key ENTER down
at 101 key ENTER up
at 270 key RIGHT down
at 300 key RIGHT up
at 500 key ESC down
at 501 key ESC up
at 550 key DOWN down
at 551 key DOWN up
at 600 key ENTER down
at 601 key ENTER up
at 650 key UP down
at 651 key UP up
at 700 key ENTER down
at 701 key ENTER up
